WEBVTT

00:12.840 --> 00:14.240
Your Highness

00:17.960 --> 00:20.080
My men will follow all the way

00:20.160 --> 00:21.800
No one can mistreat you

00:21.880 --> 00:23.080
Teacher Yu

00:23.160 --> 00:24.560
Some things

00:25.240 --> 00:27.240
Hear but don't take to heart

00:27.440 --> 00:29.107
As long as one lives

00:29.280 --> 00:30.680
That's what matters most

00:31.280 --> 00:32.680
This subject

00:33.400 --> 00:35.640
Has brought trouble upon Your Highness

00:41.360 --> 00:42.760
I hope Teacher Yu

00:44.280 --> 00:45.680
Will take care

00:51.400 --> 00:52.840
Your Highness, take care

01:32.480 --> 01:33.880
What are you doing?

01:40.240 --> 01:41.640
Your students

01:42.160 --> 01:44.360
Thank Your Highness for your grace

01:45.000 --> 01:46.640
Thank you, Your Highness

01:46.840 --> 01:48.800
For protecting our teacher's life

01:51.800 --> 01:54.040
If there is an opportunity in the future

01:54.120 --> 01:56.453
We will repay Your Highness's great kindness

01:57.160 --> 01:58.560
Enough

01:58.800 --> 02:01.467
You are all pillars of Great Xuan's future

02:03.120 --> 02:04.520
Rise quickly

02:04.840 --> 02:06.240
All of you, rise

02:09.360 --> 02:10.760
This matter

02:11.720 --> 02:14.720
I hope you all take it as a warning

02:14.800 --> 02:17.160
I will also take it as a warning

02:17.240 --> 02:18.640
Your students

02:18.800 --> 02:21.000
Will remember Your Highness's teachings
